<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - May 15.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - May 15.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Tele-Communications Inc first-quarter loss narrows.</p>
<p>* The distribution methods of Philip Morris Co are under investigation by the U.S. Federal Trade Commission - Wall Street Journal.  </p>
<p>* Investment Bank SBC Warburg had no comment on reports that it is poised to buy Dillon Read &amp; Co for about $600 million.</p>
<p>* Hoffman-La Roche Inc, a unit of Roche Holding Ltd, received approval for its obesity drug, Xenical, from a U.S. Food and Drug Administration panel.</p>
</text>
